      "message": "Right, I hinted a bit in the CL description that we may need to add utils/bounds_safety.h to the install. \n\nsrc/webp/types.h exports WebPMalloc and WebPFree, which would default to __single without WEBP_ASSUME_UNSAFE_INDEXABLE_ABI. \n\nIm not sure if there\u0027s a better way to do this. The paths forward I see are:\n\n1) Move the two functions out of types.h\n2) Import utils/bounds_safety.h and provide it as part of the install (which we\u0027ll need to do if we ever annotate public functions)\n3) Provide a minimal version of bounds_safety.h which provides __sized_by or the pragma behind WEBP_ASSUME_UNSAFE_INDEXABLE_ABI\n\nThere\u0027s probably some more options I\u0027m unaware of, though :) Happy to hear your thoughts",
